concept:law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011-sch-1-sec-4 cml:asserts concept:law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011-sch-1-sec-4-logic-cogai-6 .
