concept:law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011-sch-1-sec-372-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "372 3  Possession of equipment used to make identification"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-372-3 ;
    values:originalText "documentation  (1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) the first person possesses equipment; and  (b) the first person intends that any person (whether or not the first person) will use the equipment to make identification documentation; and  (c) the first person intends that any person (whether or not referred to in paragraph (b)) will use the identification documentation to engage in conduct; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003  Schedule 1  Identity crimes" ;
    skos:definition "documentation  (1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) the first person possesses equipment; and  (b) the first person intends that any person (whether or not the first person) will use the equipment to make identification documentation; and  (c) the first person intends that any person (whether or not referred to in paragraph (b)) will use the identification documentation to engage in conduct; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003  Schedule 1  Identity crimes"@en ;
