    skos:prefLabel "2011 No. 3, 2011"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-2011-4 ;
    values:originalText "(b) the first person prevents the other person from attending as a witness, or from producing anything in evidence, pursuant to the subpoena or summons; and  (c) the judicial proceeding is a federal judicial proceeding. Penalty: Imprisonment for 1 year.  (2) Absolute liability applies to the paragraph (1)(c) element of the offence. Note: For absolute liability, see section 6.2 of the Criminal Code." ;
    skos:definition "(b) the first person prevents the other person from attending as a witness, or from producing anything in evidence, pursuant to the subpoena or summons; and  (c) the judicial proceeding is a federal judicial proceeding. Penalty: Imprisonment for 1 year.  (2) Absolute liability applies to the paragraph (1)(c) element of the offence. Note: For absolute liability, see section 6.2 of the Criminal Code."@en ;
