    cml:logicSummary "Prohibits aiding a prisoner to escape." ;
    cml:premiseText "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) another person (the prisoner) is in criminal detention; and  (b) the first person aids the prisoner:  (i) to escape from that detention; or  (ii) to attempt to escape from that detention; and  (c) the prisoner escapes, or attempts to escape, from that detention; and  (d) the detention is lawful federal criminal detention." ;
    cml:conclusionText "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) another person (the prisoner) is in criminal detention; and  (b) the first person aids the prisoner:  (i) to escape from that detention; or  (ii) to attempt to escape from that detention; and  (c) the prisoner escapes, or attempts to escape, from that detention; and  (d) the detention is lawful federal criminal detention." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
