    values:originalText "Insert: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003  Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006  Schedule 4  Law and Justice Legislation Amendment (Identity Crimes and Other Measures) Act 2011       No. 3, 2011            33  (3A) Subsection (3) does not apply to AUSTRAC information that:  (a) was obtained under section 41; or  (b) was obtained under section 49, in so far as that section relates to a communication under section 41; or  (c) was obtained under section 16 of the Financial Transaction Reports Act 1988." ;
