concept:law-and-justice-legislation-amendment-identity-crimes-and-other-measures-act-2011-sch-5-sec-2011 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2011 No. 3, 2011"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-2011 ;
    values:originalText "(1A) If the Commissioner is satisfied that a person (other than an AFP appointee) has, by his or her bravery, or other conspicuous conduct, in assisting the Australian Federal Police, merited a prescribed award, the Commissioner may confer the award on that person." ;
