    skos:prefLabel "4 Subsection 55T(2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (2) The CEO must be a person whose name is on:  (a) the roll of barristers and solicitors of the High Court kept under the Rules of Court; or  (b) the roll of barristers, solicitors, barristers and solicitors or legal practitioners of the Supreme Court of a State or Territory. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003  Schedule 7  Miscellaneous amendments" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (2) The CEO must be a person whose name is on:  (a) the roll of barristers and solicitors of the High Court kept under the Rules of Court; or  (b) the roll of barristers, solicitors, barristers and solicitors or legal practitioners of the Supreme Court of a State or Territory. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00003  Schedule 7  Miscellaneous amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7cf6e372994793ec687b3d0e561fb4963e60962e2600d6069cec0ca107b1cbe5" ;
    cof:pageNumber "41"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must be a barrister or solicitor on the specified rolls." ;
